      "description": "Grab your students’ attention and take control of classroom noise.\n\nClass Noise scans sound levels and gives students time to quiet down. When they succeed, they’re rewarded with a fun animation. Simple, effective, and gamified the right way.\n\nTelling kids to “quiet down” over and over feels unprofessional and rarely works. Class Noise turns classroom management into a game—helping you grab attention and keep students focused.\n\nFor less than the price of a coffee—without subscriptions or annoying ads—you’ll get a tool that helps with one of the hardest parts of teaching: managing classroom noise. Bring calm back to your classroom with Class Noise.\n\nClass Noise includes the features teachers ask for most:\n+ Settings saved between sessions\n+ Adjustable sensitivity for different classroom environments\n+ A variety of delightful feedback animations\n+ Works without blocking your Smart Board\n+ Quick scans from 3 seconds or longer—choose what works best for you\n+ Works offline, ad-free, and private\n\nAs a teacher myself, I know how critical it is to capture attention and lower noise quickly. This app solved that challenge for me, and I’m confident it will do the same for you.",
